mv - give a file a new name

SYNOPSIS
    mv old new

DESCRIPTION
    Rename the file or directory old to the pathname new. Both pathnames
    must be on the same filesystem. An existing regular file can be
    replaced by a regular file and an empty directory by a directory.

SEE ALSO
    cp(1), ln(1), rm(1)
